{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/viewspacing\/distance(to:along:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gets the preferred spacing distance along the specified axis to the view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that returns a specified spacing preference."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"distance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"next","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ViewSpacing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI11ViewSpacingV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"along","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"axis","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Axis","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4AxisO","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Axis"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Float","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"next","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The spacing preferences instance of the adjacent view."}]}]},{"name":"axis","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The axis that the two views align on."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A floating point value that represents the smallest distance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in points between two views that satisfies the spacing preferences"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of both this view and the adjacent views on their shared edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your implementation of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"methods if you need to measure the default spacing between two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views in a custom layout. Call the method on the first view’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"preferences instance, and provide the second view’s preferences","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"instance as input."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, consider two views that appear in a custom horizontal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stack. The following distance call gets the preferred spacing between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these views, where "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spacing1"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the preferences of a first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, and "},{"code":"spacing2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the preferences of a second view:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["let distance = spacing1.distance(to: spacing2, axis: .horizontal)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method first determines, based on the axis and the ordering, that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the views abut on the trailing edge of the first view and the leading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge of the second. It then gets the spacing preferences for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding edges of each view, and returns the greater of the two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values. This results in the smallest value that provides enough space"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to satisfy the preferences of both views."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method returns the default spacing between views, but a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout can choose to ignore the value and use custom spacing instead."}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"distance(to:along:)","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI11ViewSpacingV8distance2to5alongSfAC_AA4AxisOtF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"distance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ViewSpacing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI11ViewSpacingV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"along","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Axis","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4AxisO"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Float","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ViewSpacing\/distance(to:along:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Axis":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Axis","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Axis","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"t